@startuml data-flow
title 数据流 — 数据源插件 / 绑定读写

skinparam shadowing false

actor "车辆 / Android 侧" as veh
participant "datasource.xml" as xml
participant "Java 数据源插件" as plug
participant "Kanzi 数据模型\n(DataSource)" as dm
participant "UI 节点" as ui

== 初始化 ==
xml -> plug : 解析,定义字段/类型
plug -> dm : 暴露 DataObject 树

== 读(监听)==
dm --> ui : 普通绑定 → 属性自动刷新

== 写(交互)==
ui -> dm : To-Source 绑定 → 回写 DataObject
dm -> plug : 值变更
plug -> veh : 下发指令(开窗/落锁…)

== 运行时更新 ==
veh -> plug : 真实信号
plug -> dm : 更新值
dm --> ui : 自动刷新(含 <signal>Valid 故障态)

@enduml
